# What NOT to upload to App Engine.
#
# We exclude src/ on purpose: App Engine must serve the .next/ that CI already
# built (npm install + next start), NOT rebuild from source. Excluding src/
# guarantees the buildpack can't re-run the build. So KEEP .next/ uploaded.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
node_modules
src/

# Keep content/*.md (guides + stories) — src/lib/content.ts reads them from
# disk at request time (getAllPosts → fs.readdirSync). Without them, the
# /guides and /stories pages + their sitemap entries would be empty.
# So only exclude top-level docs (README.md, etc.), not content/**.
/*.md
